    <div class="profile-item-card" style="display: flex; justify-content: start; align-items: center; background: transparent; width: 100%; max-width: 850px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 5px;"><span class="label3" style="color: black; text-align: start; display: block; width: 100%; margin-left: 30px; font-size: 14px;">Senheng Affiliate Program enables participants to promote a variety of products from brands available on the Senheng App. Affiliates earn Commissions on Qualified Sales driven through their unique referral links. By joining, you agree to these terms and conditions.<br>These Terms and Conditions form an integral part of the Senheng Affiliate Program Agreement and supplement the Senheng Terms of Service and other applicable Senheng Policies. By participating in the Senheng Affiliate Program, you agree to comply with these terms, along with all other policies outlined on the Senheng App and website.<br>Senheng reserves the right to update or modify these Terms and Conditions, policies, and Commission structures at any time at its sole discretion. Changes to these Terms and Conditions will take effect at the latest one (1) day from notification to affiliates. Continued participation implies acceptance of revised terms.<br>Affiliates are responsible for reviewing updates, policy changes, and Commission adjustments. Continued participation in the program after any changes take effect will be considered acceptance of the updated terms. If the affiliate does not agree with any modifications, they must discontinue participation in the Senheng Affiliate Program, and the Agreement will be terminated. <br>This Agreement is limited to individuals legally eligible to enter into contracts under applicable laws. Affiliates represent and warrant that:<br>i) They have full authority to enter into and fulfill their obligations under this Agreement.<br>ii) Any information provided to Senheng is, and will remain, accurate, up to date, and complete at all times.<br>By joining the Senheng Affiliate Program, affiliates acknowledge their rights and obligations under these terms and agree to abide by all program requirements.<br></span></div>
