    </div>
    <div class="profile-item-card" style="display: flex; justify-content: start; align-items: center; background: transparent; width: 100%; max-width: 850px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 5px;"><span class="label3" style="color: black; text-align: start; display: block; width: 100%; margin-left: 30px; font-size: 14px;">1.1 Account Balance: The account maintained by Senheng where payments of accumulated and unpaid Commission Fees or other amounts due and payable to Affiliate under the Program will be made. <br>1.2 Affiliate(s): Participant(s) approved to promote products available on the Senheng App, Senheng website, or senQ website, excluding those under the Redeem category, through referral links. <br>1.3 Affiliate Links: A unique URL from Senheng that Affiliates use to promote Products, track sales, and earn Commissions. <br>1.4 Chargebacks: Refunded or canceled sales that are ineligible for Commission. <br>1.5 Commission(s): A monetary reward earned by Affiliates for Qualified Sales made through Affiliate Links <br>1.6 Platform: Refers to any online channels, websites, applications, or digital interfaces through which Affiliates may promote Senheng products using their unique referral links, including but not limited to social media platforms, blogs, websites, and messaging services. <br>1.7 Product(s): Any eligible item listed on the Senheng App, Senheng website, or senQ website, excluding those under the Redeem category, offered by sellers for sale to buyers. (Subject to change). <br>1.8 Program: Refers to the Senheng Affiliate Program, including all related campaigns, initiatives, benefits, and Commission structures, as governed by these Program Terms and Conditions. <br>1.9 Program Platform: Refers to all digital platforms specifically related to the Senheng Affiliate Program, including the Senheng App, the Senheng website (www.senheng.com.my) and the senQ website (www.senq.com.my), as well as any other platforms designated by Senheng for the operation and management of the Affiliate Program. <br>1.10 Program Terms and Conditions: Refers to the terms, conditions, policies, and guidelines governing participation in the Senheng Affiliate Program, including all rules, requirements, and obligations outlined herein and any subsequent amendments or updates as determined by Senheng. <br>1.11 Qualified Sale(s): A purchase made on the Senheng App or Senheng and senQ website via an Affiliate’s unique link, excluding returns, refunds or cancellations. <br>1.12&nbsp; Senheng: Refers to SENHENG ELECTRIC (KL) SDN. BHD. <br>1.13 Senheng Platform: Refers to all official digital and physical platforms owned, operated, or managed by Senheng Electric (KL) Sdn Bhd and S Ecosystem (M) Sdn Bhd, including but not limited to websites, mobile applications, social media accounts, and physical retail stores. <br>1.14 Term: The meaning set forth in Section 12.1. <br>1.15 Territory: The territory in which the Senheng entity that is engaging the Affiliate is domiciled.</span></div>
