    <div class="profile-item-card" style="display: flex; justify-content: start; align-items: center; background: transparent; width: 100%; max-width: 850px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 5px;"><span class="label3" style="color: black; text-align: start; display: block; width: 100%; margin-left: 30px; font-size: 14px;">3.1 Affiliates must complete the registration process with accurate information, ensuring it matches the details used when signing up on the Senheng App. <br>3.2 Affiliates are responsible for keeping their account details up to date and secure. <br>3.3 Each PlusOne membership number is eligible for a single registration within the Senheng Affiliate Program. <br>3.4 Multiple registrations using the same PlusOne number are not permitted. <br>3.5 Any attempt to register a previously used PlusOne number will result in a system error, and the duplicate registration will be invalid.</span></div>
