    <div class="profile-item-card" style="display: flex; justify-content: start; align-items: center; background: transparent; width: 100%; max-width: 850px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 5px;"><span class="label3" style="color: black; text-align: start; display: block; width: 100%; margin-left: 30px; font-size: 14px;">7.1 Senheng shall operate the Program Platform and the services offered thereon, such as the provision of product feeds, on a best efforts basis. Senheng shall not be required to provide error-free and interruption-free availability of the Program Platform. The level of quality and the correctness of Product descriptions on the Program Platform and on the csv files, etc. provided on the Program Platform, shall fall within the exclusive discretion of Senheng. <br>7.2 All activities of the Affiliate shall be logged via the Program Platform tracking system and made accessible to the Affiliate via statistics and reports.<br>7.3 Any typographical clerical or other error or omission in the Program Platform or other Senheng document shall be subject to correction without any liability for Senheng.</span></div>
    <div class="profile-setting-container2">
        <div class="profile-item-card" style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; background: transparent; width: 100%; max-width: 850px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 5px;"><span class="label3" style="color: black; text-align: start; display: block; width: 100%; font-size: 14px;"><strong>8. Chargebacks</strong></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="profile-item-card" style="display: flex; justify-content: start; align-items: center; background: transparent; width: 100%; max-width: 850px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 5px;"><span class="label3" style="color: black; text-align: start; display: block; width: 100%; margin-left: 30px; font-size: 14px;">8.1 If a customer requests and receives a refund for a purchase, the Commission earned from that transaction will be deducted. If the affiliate has already received the commission, the refunded amount will be deducted from future earnings. <br>8.2 Example Scenarios:<br>Scenario 1 - Refund After Commission Payout<br>Customer A makes a purchase through Affiliate B’s referral link.<br>Customer A later requests a refund, which is approved after the commission payout.<br>If another customer (Customer C) makes a purchase through Affiliate B’s link, the refund amount from Customer A’s order will be deducted from Affiliate B’s next commission payout.<br>Scenario 2 - Refund Before Commission Payout<br>Customer A makes a purchase through Affiliate B’s referral link.<br>Customer A later requests a refund, which is approved before the commission payout.<br>The commission from this sale will be rejected before the payout.<br>8.3 Senheng reserves the right to adjust Commission payments to reflect any chargebacks, refunds, or cancellations, ensuring commissions are only paid for completed and valid sales.</span></div>
    <div class="profile-setting-container2">
        <div class="profile-item-card" style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; background: transparent; width: 100%; max-width: 850px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 5px;"><span class="label3" style="color: black; text-align: start; display: block; width: 100%; font-size: 14px;"><strong>9. Commissions and Payments</strong></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="profile-item-card" style="display: flex; justify-content: start; align-items: center; background: transparent; width: 100%; max-width: 850px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 5px;"><span class="label3" style="color: black; text-align: start; display: block; width: 100%; margin-left: 30px; font-size: 14px;">9.1 Senheng shall pay the Affiliate a Commission on Qualified Sales. <br>9.2 Commissions are earned on confirmed purchases made via the Affiliate’s referral links. <br>9.3 All fees payable to an Affiliate shall be added to the Affiliate’s Account Balance on a monthly basis. <br>9.4 The Affiliate will be paid within thirty (30) days from the invoice. <br>9.5 Payments are made via bank transfer. <br>9.6 Affiliates are eligible to cash out earnings as long as the balance meets the minimum threshold of RM80. <br>9.7 If Affiliate's Account Balance is below the minimum threshold in a given payment period, Senheng reserves the right to withhold such amounts due to Affiliate until such payment period where Affiliate’s Account Balance has met the minimum threshold. <br>9.8 Senheng shall not make Commission payouts on, and reserves the right (at its sole and absolute discretion) to set-off, deduct or initiate chargebacks on transactions that were previously paid out (including to require Payee to transfer to Senheng any amounts that were previously paid out) or are currently in the payout process. Such transactions include but are not limited to: <br>(a) transactions that do not meet the requirements to be a Qualified Sale; <br>(b) fraudulent transactions identified manually or by means of a fraudulent order checking process; <br>(c) cancelled, incomplete, returned or refunded transactions; <br>(d) transactions involving any prohibited actions described in Section 10 <br>9.9 The Commission structure may be modified at any time in order to incentivize best practices as provided for under Section 12.</span></div>
    <div class="profile-setting-container2">
        <div class="profile-item-card" style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; background: transparent; width: 100%; max-width: 850px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 5px;"><span class="label3" style="color: black; text-align: start; display: block; width: 100%; font-size: 14px;"><strong>10. Prohibited Practices</strong></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="profile-item-card" style="display: flex; justify-content: start; align-items: center; background: transparent; width: 100%; max-width: 850px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 5px;"><span class="label3" style="color: black; text-align: start; display: block; width: 100%; margin-left: 30px; font-size: 14px;">10.1 Affiliates must not:<br>(a) use unethical promotion methods like spam;<br>(b) engage in fraudulent activities to manipulate traffic or sales;<br>(c) offer or accept any form of bribe or improper incentive to influence results;<br>(d) without Senheng's prior written consent, be allowed to use EDMs to promote Senheng, the Program Platform or for any other purpose under this Agreement. The Affiliate will hold Senheng harmless in case of issues arising out of any EDM and guarantees it will take full and sole responsibility for any issues stemming from such EDM. The Affiliate is not allowed to use the brand ""Senheng"" within the e-mail address, within the URL, within the source code, and within the subject of the e-mail. The Affiliate has to make sure that it is clear that the e-mail comes from the Affiliate and not from Senheng directly. The e-mail has to be approved by Senheng before it is sent;<br>(e) advertise Senheng through social media activities (including but not limited to Facebook, Pinterest, Twitter) must be expressly approved by Senheng and may not include any Senheng trademarks, or display misleading content (i.e. that may not look like official Senheng social media activities) and any social media activities through the Facebook platform must be run through a ""Fan Page"" only and not through a ""Personal Page"" in accordance with Facebook policy;<br>(f) use offers, creative or brand names for competitions, lotteries and similar activities.<br>10.2 Affiliate will also not allow any third party to do the following:<br>(a) use robots or other automated query tools, computer generated search requests;<br>(b) fraudulent use of search engine optimization services to generate or conceal impressions, inquiries, clicks, or conversions that are fraudulent or invalid;<br>(c) apply Affiliate Links on Platform that contains Prohibited Content, or in torrent or streaming sites;<br>(d) apply Affiliate Links or advertise through any of Senheng’s social media channels or the social media channels of any Senheng’s Sellers/other affiliates to hijack traffic;<br>(e) providing social media channels of other Affiliates without consent to meet registration criteria;<br>(f) steal other Affiliate publishers' content and publish it as their own without asking for consent, and/or giving credit;<br>(g) use a bank account that is not registered under the Affiliate's legal name;<br>(h) commit any fraudulent acts, whether or not such fraudulent acts result in any financial gains or losses.<br>10.3 The Affiliate covenants that it has and will maintain all licenses, permits, approvals, registrations or the like, to perform the matters contemplated under this Agreement and that it shall carry out this Agreement in compliance with all applicable laws in Malaysia and any other applicable jurisdiction.<br>10.4 Actions for non-compliance. Without limiting any other action Senheng may take against the Affiliate, in the event the Affiliate is found to have breached any of its responsibilities under these Program Terms and Conditions, the Affiliate agrees that Senheng may, in its sole discretion, take the following actions against the Affiliate:<br>(a) issue warning letter/email to the Affiliate in respect of the Affiliate’s breach of responsibilities; and/or<br>(b) void all commissions payable to the Affiliate.</span></div>
