    <div class="profile-item-card" style="display: flex; justify-content: start; align-items: center; background: transparent; width: 100%; max-width: 850px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; padding: 5px;"><span class="label3" style="color: black; text-align: start; display: block; width: 100%; margin-left: 30px; font-size: 14px;">12.1 Term. These Program Terms and Conditions take effect on the date that Senheng approves Affiliate’s application to join the Program and continues to be in effect until terminated in accordance with Termination by Senheng. <br>12.2 Termination by Senheng. Senheng may unilaterally terminate these Program Terms and Conditions at its sole discretion and for any reason which Senheng deems appropriate and disable the Affiliate Links. Senheng may terminate these Program Terms and Conditions immediately and without any prior notice if Affiliate breaches its obligations under these Program Terms and Conditions. <br>12.3 Amendments and addenda to the Agreement shall be in writing. <br>12.4 Senheng reserves the right to update or modify these Program Terms and Conditions, policies, and Commission structures at its sole discretion, with at least one (1) day prior notification. Senheng shall not be responsible for ensuring that the communication is received by the affiliate. Continued participation in the program implies acceptance of the revised terms. In the event of disagreement, the affiliate's sole recourse shall be to terminate their participation in the program. <br>12.5 This Agreement may be terminated without any prior notice in case of violation by the Affiliate of any of its obligations or covenants under this Agreement. <br>12.6 Senheng reserves the right to withhold unpaid Commissions for a reasonable period of time following termination to account for possible Chargebacks. <br>12.7 Upon termination of this Agreement, all rights and obligations of the Parties will be extinguished, except for matters that expressly or by their nature are intended to survive.</span></div>
